  "id": "20_Leaders_Who_Built_the_CISO_Era_2_Decades_of_Change_txt_105",
  "content": "The indefatigable Moore took a rare but brief hiatus from the security industry around 2019, when he began to study the nagging IT challenge of poor visibility into devices and services on enterprise networks , an issue he had seen firsthand over and over again in his years discovering millions of exposed corporate systems. He built a new tool with IT in mind, but it quickly led him right back to security as he focused on deeper visibility of devices and interdependencies in an enterprise network. It later evolved into a commercial product with his startup runZero that spans IT, OT, IoT, mobile, and cloud assets.",
